    "description": "Objective\n\nStop asking Reps for times they do not have.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\n* Remove the time component from all user-inputted date fields (convert Date/Time -> Date)\n\n* RETAIN timestamps on system-generated fields (e.g. click timestamps, Recent Click Timestamp)\n\n* Audit each field and classify user-input vs system BEFORE converting anything\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\n* No Rep-facing input asks for a time\n\n* All system timestamps preserved\n\nRISK\n\nDate/Time -> Date is a DESTRUCTIVE field type change on existing data and cannot be undone. RECOMMENDATION: split into two steps — (1) field inventory and classification, (2) conversion with a data-preservation plan. Do not convert in an org with records in it without step 1 signed off.\n\nEstimate: S · \\~5h\n\nSource: Wagertech Additional User Stories, July 2026 — item 33.",
